  <!-- ===== FAQ SECTION ===== -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="faq-container">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-2">Everything you need to know about vendor pricing</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="question" data-target="answer1">
          <span>How is the commission calculated?</span>
          <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div id="answer1" class="answer">
          Commission is calculated as a percentage of the total order value (excluding shipping and taxes). For example, a $100 order with a 5% commission would incur a $5 fee. Internal vendors pay <strong>0% commission</strong> on every successful order.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="question" data-target="answer2">
          <span>What is the difference between Internal and External vendors?</span>
          <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div id="answer2" class="answer">
          Internal vendors are fully integrated within the COCOCE ecosystem with <strong>0% commission</strong>, priority support, and unlimited product listings. External vendors are partners with limited integration and a <strong>10% commission</strong> fee per successful order.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="question" data-target="answer3">
          <span>Can I upgrade or downgrade my vendor plan?</span>
          <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div id="answer3" class="answer">
          Yes, you can upgrade or downgrade your vendor plan at any time. Changes take effect immediately, and you'll be billed at the new commission rate for future transactions.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="question" data-target="answer4">
          <span>Are there any hidden fees?</span>
          <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div id="answer4" class="answer">
          No. The commission structure is transparent. There are no setup fees, monthly fees, or hidden charges. You only pay when you make a successful sale at your chosen commission rate.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="question" data-target="answer5">
          <span>How do I become a Preferred Vendor?</span>
          <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div id="answer5" class="answer">
          Preferred Vendor status is granted to internal vendors with a proven track record of excellent performance, high customer satisfaction, and consistent sales volume. Contact our team for more details.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
